#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Overgrowth grants +1 On Hit & On Cut quantity. One stack is consumed per "
"full Cut. "
msgstr "「繁茂」により、命中時と伐採時の入手数が+1されます。伐採を1回完了するたびに1スタックを消費します。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Major 2"
msgstr "主要ノード 2"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hitting a weakspot deals (0.1 * Max HP + 3) damage"
msgstr "弱点に命中すると（最大HP × 0.1 + 3）のダメージを与えます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Major 3"
msgstr "主要ノード 3"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Major 4"
msgstr "主要ノード 4"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Shatter grants +200% Bonus Product Quantity and +100% Bonus Skill XP"
msgstr "「粉砕」により、生産物のボーナス量 +200%、スキルXPボーナス +100%を得ます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the ability to observe [color=#FFD16D]Meteor Shower[/color] and "
"[color=#FFD16D]Starfall[/color] events in Firemaking"
msgstr ""
"火起こしで[color=#FFD16D]流星群[/color]と[color=#FFD16D]流星[/color]のイベントを観測できるようになります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the ability to obtain [color=#FFD16D]Fireflies[/color] while burning"
" Logs in Firemaking"
msgstr "火起こしで丸太を燃やしているときに[color=#FFD16D]ホタル[/color]を入手できるようになります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Astral Offerings[/color] toggle in Beastcrafting for "
"Beast Weapons and Beast Armour, allowing you to offer your crafted Item in "
"return for a potential gift."
msgstr ""
"獣工芸で、獣の武器と獣の防具に[color=#FFD16D]星への捧げもの[/color]の切り替えを解放します。製作したアイテムを捧げると、贈り物がもらえることがあります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Sacrificial Anvil[/color] in Smithing, allowing "
"you to sacrifice your smithed item in return for extra Skill XP, GP or a "
"rare Collectable"
msgstr ""
"鍛冶で[color=#FFD16D]生贄の金床[/color]を解放します。鍛えたアイテムを捧げると、追加のスキルXP、GP、またはレアな収集品が手に入ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Smelting -> Star Forge[/color] in Smithing, "
"allowing to you create Alloy Bars such as Ironsteel or Dragonrune"
msgstr "鍛冶で[color=#FFD16D]製錬 → 星の炉[/color]を解放します。鉄鋼や龍ルーンなどの合金ののべ棒を作れるようになります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Astral Jewellery[/color] in Crafting"
msgstr "工作で[color=#FFD16D]星辰の装身具[/color]を解放します。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks [color=#FFD16D]Night Sprints[/color] in Agility."
msgstr "俊敏で[color=#FFD16D]夜間疾走[/color]を解放します。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyNode.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Catalyst Toolbelt Slot[/color] in Herblore"
msgstr "調合で[color=#FFD16D]触媒のツールベルト枠[/color]を解放します。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Observation"
msgid_plural "Observations"
msgstr[0] "観測"
msgstr[1] "観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You study the stars carefully, but they remain silent."
msgstr "星をじっくり観察しますが、星は黙ったままです。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation offers no insight this time."
msgstr "今回は星座から何の手がかりも得られませんでした。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Whatever message the stars held has slipped away."
msgstr "星々が伝えようとしていたことは、どこかへ消えてしまいました。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You sense a faint presence among the stars, but it quickly fades."
msgstr "星々の間にかすかな気配を感じましたが、すぐに消えてしまいました。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation's light flickers without revealing its secrets."
msgstr "星座の光はまたたくばかりで、その秘密を明かしてはくれません。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You wait patiently for a sign, but none arrives."
msgstr "辛抱強くしるしを待ちますが、何も現れません。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You almost discern a message before it vanishes from your thoughts."
msgstr "あと少しで意味を読み取れそうでしたが、その言葉は頭から消えてしまいました。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation politely declines to elaborate."
msgstr "星座は、これ以上の説明を丁重にお断りしています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You feel certain the stars judged your attempt. They offer no further "
"comment."
msgstr "星々があなたの試みを採点したのは間違いなさそうです。講評はありません。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Even the stars have off days."
msgstr "星にだって調子の悪い日はあります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You continue to observe the stars, confirming that they are indeed stars."
msgstr "観察を続けた結果、星が確かに星であることを確認しました。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Deedree Observation"
msgid_plural "Deedree Observations"
msgstr[0] "ディードリーの観測"
msgstr[1] "ディードリーの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that talking to plants helps. They refuse to comment on "
"whether the plants listen."
msgstr "植物に話しかけると効果がある、と星々は言い張ります。植物が聞いているかどうかについては答えてくれません。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation warns that the tallest tree always wins an argument with a"
" blunt axe."
msgstr "切れ味の悪い斧で口論をしても、勝つのはいつも一番高い木だと星座は警告しています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that weeds are simply crops with exceptional confidence."
msgstr "雑草とは、自信が並外れて強いだけの作物なのだと星々が明かします。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars suggest that planting today is wiser than promising you'll plant "
"tomorrow."
msgstr "明日植えると約束するより、今日植える方が賢明だと星々は言います。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every mighty Oak Tree was once a seed that ignored "
"terrible advice."
msgstr "どんなに立派なオークの木も、かつてはひどい助言を聞き流した一粒の種だったと星座は言います。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars quietly remind you that chopping the tree before collecting the "
"fruit is rarely the optimal strategy."
msgstr "実を集める前に木を切り倒すのは、たいてい得策ではないと星々がそっと教えてくれます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Terra Observation"
msgid_plural "Terra Observations"
msgstr[0] "テラの観測"
msgstr[1] "テラの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder why you're not mining Coal right now."
msgstr "なぜ今、石炭を採掘していないのかと星々は不思議がっています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that hitting the rock harder is a valid mining strategy."
msgstr "岩をもっと強くたたくのも立派な採掘法だと星々は言い張ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellations insists you are one Geode away from finding that rare "
"item."
msgstr "あのレアアイテムまで、あとジオード1個だと星座は言い張ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder how staring at them all night helps build Strength."
msgstr "一晩中星を眺めて、どうして力が鍛えられるのかと星々は不思議がっています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that a high Strength level won't save you from"
" the Coal mines."
msgstr "力のレベルが高くても炭鉱行きは免れないと星座が念を押します。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars stare back at you."
msgstr "星々が見つめ返してきます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Ameria Observation"
msgid_plural "Ameria Observations"
msgstr[0] "アメリアの観測"
msgstr[1] "アメリアの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars whisper that fish are far less cooperative once they realize "
"they're on the menu."
msgstr "自分が献立に載っていると気づいた魚は、ずっと非協力的になると星々がささやきます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars suggest drying your firewood before complaining that it won't "
"burn."
msgstr "薪が燃えないと文句を言う前に、まず乾かしてみてはどうかと星々は勧めています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that cooking the fish is generally easier "
"after you've caught it."
msgstr "魚を料理するのは、たいてい釣り上げた後の方が簡単だと星座が教えてくれます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that a warm campfire has ended more adventures "
"than any monster."
msgstr "温かい焚き火は、どんなモンスターよりも多くの冒険を終わらせてきたと星座は言い張ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars guide you to a secluded steam within the Shrapnel River."
msgstr "星々が、シュラプネル川の人目につかない流れへと導いてくれます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonlit Stream "
"Fishing spot.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]この観測により、釣り場「月明かりの小川」を利用できるようになります。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Midnight Cove of Ameria"
msgid_plural "Midnight Cove of Ameria"
msgstr[0] "アメリアの真夜中の入り江"
msgstr[1] "アメリアの真夜中の入り江"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars guide you to a hidden spot along the Windy Coastline."
msgstr "星々が、風の吹く海岸沿いの隠れた場所へと導いてくれます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Midnight Cove "
"Fishing spot.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]この観測により、釣り場「真夜中の入り江」を利用できるようになります。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Ceedyr Observation"
msgid_plural "Ceedyr Observations"
msgstr[0] "シーディアの観測"
msgstr[1] "シーディアの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every perfect hide once belonged to something that "
"strongly preferred keeping it."
msgstr "見事な毛皮はどれも、かつてはそれを手放したくなかった何者かのものだったと星座は言います。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why creatures are so attached to materials you "
"clearly need for crafting."
msgstr "製作に必要なのは明らかなのに、なぜ生き物たちは素材にあれほど執着するのかと星座は不思議がっています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars remind you that chasing wildlife is considerably easier without "
"carrying half your workshop."
msgstr "工房の半分を背負っていなければ、野生動物を追うのはずっと楽だと星々が教えてくれます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that \"I'll just hunt one more\" has misled countless "
"adventurers."
msgstr "「あと1匹だけ狩ろう」という言葉に、数えきれない冒険者が惑わされてきたと星々は言い張ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reveals that collecting \"just in case\" materials "
"eventually becomes a storage problem."
msgstr "「念のため」に集めた素材は、いずれ保管場所の問題になると星座が明かします。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Moonlit Hills of Ceedyr"
msgid_plural "Moonlit Hills of Ceedyr"
msgstr[0] "シーディアの月明かりの丘"
msgstr[1] "シーディアの月明かりの丘"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation lights a path towards a hidden opening in the Hills."
msgstr "星座の光が、丘に隠された入り口への道を照らします。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonlit Hills "
"Hunting Location.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]この観測により、狩猟場「月明かりの丘」を利用できるようになります。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Crescent Lake of Iridan"
msgid_plural "Crescent Lake of Iridan"
msgstr[0] "イリダンの三日月湖"
msgstr[1] "イリダンの三日月湖"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation points toward a tranquil lake where the water curves like "
"a crescent moon. A hidden shoreline beckons those willing to seek it."
msgstr "星座が指し示すのは、水辺が三日月のように弧を描く静かな湖です。隠れた岸辺が、探し求める者を招いています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Crescent Lake "
"Combat Area.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]この観測により、戦闘エリア「三日月湖」を利用できるようになります。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Iridan Observation"
msgid_plural "Iridan Observations"
msgstr[0] "イリダンの観測"
msgstr[1] "イリダンの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars claim that yelling while attacking increases accuracy."
msgstr "攻撃しながら叫ぶと命中率が上がると星々は主張しています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars remind you that every dent in your armour is a valuable lesson. "
"Preferably someone else's lesson."
msgstr "防具のへこみはどれも貴重な教訓だと星々は言います。できれば他人の教訓であってほしいものです。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims that missing your target is not a valid strategy."
msgstr "的を外すのは正当な作戦ではないと星座は言います。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars claim every unique weapon began life as \"good enough for now.\""
msgstr "どんな固有の武器も、始まりは「今はこれで十分」だったと星々は言います。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars insist that hitting harder is a perfectly valid strategy."
msgstr "もっと強く打つのも立派な作戦だと星々は言い張ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Syllia Observation"
msgid_plural "Syllia Observations"
msgstr[0] "シリアの観測"
msgstr[1] "シリアの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every arrow flies true until the wind develops a "
"personality."
msgstr "風が気まぐれを起こすまでは、どの矢もまっすぐ飛ぶと星座は言います。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars suggest aiming before celebrating the shot."
msgstr "命中を喜ぶ前に、まず狙いを定めてはどうかと星々は勧めています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that trees rarely volunteer to become arrows."
msgstr "自分から矢になりたがる木はめったにないと星座が教えてくれます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder why arrows are always found in the most inconvenient "
"places."
msgstr "なぜ矢はいつも一番取りにくい場所で見つかるのかと星々は不思議がっています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims a quiver is merely a very organised collection of "
"future mistakes."
msgstr "矢筒とは、未来の失敗をきちんと整理して入れておく入れ物にすぎないと星座は言います。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation advises remembering that boomerangs are designed to "
"return."
msgstr "ブーメランは戻ってくるように作られていることを忘れないようにと星座は忠告します。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Haemir Observation"
msgid_plural "Haemir Observations"
msgstr[0] "ヘミールの観測"
msgstr[1] "ヘミールの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Placeholder to replace."
msgstr "差し替え予定の仮テキストです。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Arachi Observation"
msgid_plural "Arachi Observations"
msgstr[0] "アラチの観測"
msgstr[1] "アラチの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that every spell is perfectly safe until proven otherwise."
msgstr "危険だと証明されるまでは、どんな呪文も完全に安全だと星々は言い張ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why wizards keep writing things down when they can"
" barely read their own spellbooks."
msgstr "自分の呪文書もろくに読めないのに、なぜ魔法使いは書き留め続けるのかと星座は不思議がっています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The heavens insist that magical explosions are merely enthusiastic "
"successes."
msgstr "魔法の爆発とは、熱意あふれる成功にすぎないと天は言い張ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every great mage has accidentally cast something they "
"absolutely didn't mean to."
msgstr "偉大な魔術師は誰しも、まったく意図しない呪文をうっかり唱えたことがあると星々が明かします。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that staring at it all night won't solve your "
"Rune supply problems."
msgstr "一晩中星座を見つめていても、ルーン不足は解決しないと星座が念を押します。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Astral Learning of Arachi"
msgid_plural "Astral Learnings of Arachi"
msgstr[0] "アラチの星界の学び"
msgstr[1] "アラチの星界の学び"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"You somehow learn a new form of Magic by simply looking at the stars and "
"pretending to read them or something lol."
msgstr "星を眺めて読んでいるふりをしていたら、なぜか新しい魔法を覚えてしまいました。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with the knowledge to use Astral "
"Spells.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]この観測により、星界呪文を使う知識を得ます。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Astral Learning of Hyden"
msgid_plural "Astral Learnings of Hyden"
msgstr[0] "ハイデンの星界の学び"
msgstr[1] "ハイデンの星界の学び"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reveals an ancient rite. Its celestial words awaken the "
"power of Astral Prayers."
msgstr "星座が古の儀式を明かします。その天上の言葉が、星界の祈りの力を目覚めさせます。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with the knowledge to use Astral "
"Prayers.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]この観測により、星界の祈りを使う知識を得ます。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Hyden Observation"
msgid_plural "Hyden Observations"
msgstr[0] "ハイデンの観測"
msgstr[1] "ハイデンの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that blessed logs burn brighter than ordinary ones. "
"Coincidence, perhaps."
msgstr "祝福された丸太は普通の丸太より明るく燃えると星々が明かします。偶然かもしれませんが。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder who first looked at a pile of bones and thought, \"The gods"
" will love this.\""
msgstr "骨の山を見て「神々はきっとこれを喜ぶ」と最初に考えたのは誰なのかと星々は不思議がっています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insist that divine favour cannot be bought. Offerings, "
"however, are gladly accepted."
msgstr "神の加護はお金では買えないと星座は言い張ります。ただし、捧げものは喜んで受け取るそうです。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims the gods have excellent taste in offerings, though "
"their preferences remain oddly specific."
msgstr "神々は捧げものの趣味がとても良いと星座は言います。ただ、好みは妙に細かいようです。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation observes that the gods rarely explain why they like bones."
" They simply do."
msgstr "神々がなぜ骨を好むのか、説明することはめったにないと星座は言います。ただ好きなのです。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Moonscarred Crater of Vale"
msgid_plural "Moonscarred Crater of Vale"
msgstr[0] "ヴェイルの月傷のクレーター"
msgstr[1] "ヴェイルの月傷のクレーター"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal a crater where moonlight never truly fades. Something "
"ancient still stirs within its scar."
msgstr "星々が、月明かりが決して消えないクレーターを示します。その傷跡の中では、今も太古の何かがうごめいています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.UnlockText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=green]This observation grants you with access to the Moonscarred "
"Crater Slayer Zone.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]この観測により、討伐エリア「月傷のクレーター」を利用できるようになります。[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Vale Observation"
msgid_plural "Vale Observations"
msgstr[0] "ヴェイルの観測"
msgstr[1] "ヴェイルの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder where your ingredients go when you fail to cook something."
msgstr "料理に失敗したとき、材料はどこへ行くのかと星々は不思議がっています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims a hearty meal can solve many problems. The "
"remaining problems usually require a weapon."
msgstr "しっかりした食事は多くの問題を解決すると星座は言います。残りの問題には、たいてい武器が必要です。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that eating during a battle is a skill worthy of "
"admiration."
msgstr "戦闘中に食事をするのは称賛に値する技だと星座は言い張ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that a full stomach is often the first step toward "
"surviving the next encounter."
msgstr "満腹でいることが、次の戦いを生き延びる第一歩になることが多いと星々が明かします。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every meal tastes better after narrowly avoiding "
"defeat."
msgstr "敗北をぎりぎりで免れた後の食事は、どれもいっそうおいしいと星座は言います。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Ko Observation"
msgid_plural "Ko Observations"
msgstr[0] "コーの観測"
msgstr[1] "コーの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The constellation claims locked doors are merely suggestions."
msgstr "鍵のかかった扉は、ただの提案にすぎないと星座は言います。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every graceful landing is built upon countless less "
"graceful ones."
msgstr "華麗な着地はどれも、数えきれないほどの華麗でない着地の上に成り立っていると星々が明かします。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars wonder why NPCs cannot pickpocket you as well."
msgstr "なぜNPCはこちらの懐をスリ返せないのかと星々は不思議がっています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation hints at accepting bribes for more Stealth in return."
msgstr "賄賂を受け取る代わりに隠密度を上げてもよいと星座がほのめかしています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation wonders why a very specific item seems to constantly "
"appear on random routes."
msgstr "なぜランダムなルートで、ある特定のアイテムばかりが出てくるのかと星座は不思議がっています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation reminds you that it cannot assist with your Lockpick "
"problem."
msgstr "ピッキングツールの問題は手伝えないと星座が念を押します。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#. AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Tellus Observation"
msgid_plural "Tellus Observations"
msgstr[0] "テラスの観測"
msgstr[1] "テラスの観測"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars insist that the best defence is letting the monster become someone"
" else's assignment."
msgstr "最高の防御とは、そのモンスターを誰か別の人の任務にしてしまうことだと星々は言い張ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation claims every Slayer task looks reasonable until you "
"actually arrive."
msgstr "討伐タスクはどれも、実際に現地に着くまではもっともらしく見えると星座は言います。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that shields are much easier to repair than confidence."
msgstr "盾を直すのは、自信を取り戻すよりずっと簡単だと星々が明かします。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars wonder if Slayer Masters secretly compete to invent increasingly "
"inconvenient tasks."
msgstr "討伐マスターたちは、ますます面倒なタスクを考え出す腕をひそかに競っているのではないかと星々は疑っています。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The constellation insists that \"just one more monster\" has delayed many "
"journeys home."
msgstr "「あと1匹だけ」という言葉が、多くの帰り道を遅らせてきたと星座は言い張ります。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"The stars reveal that every experienced slayer has confidently attacked the "
"wrong monster at least once."
msgstr "経験豊富な討伐者なら誰でも、一度は自信満々で別のモンスターに攻撃したことがあると星々が明かします。"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Ceedyr's Pathway"
msgid_plural "Ceedyr's Pathways"
msgstr[0] "シーディアの小道"
msgstr[1] "シーディアの小道"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=orange][b]Ceedyr shines brightly, revealing a path "
"forward.[/b][/color]"
msgstr "[color=orange][b]シーディアが明るく輝き、進むべき道を示しています。[/b][/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Iridan's Pathway"
msgid_plural "Iridan's Pathways"
msgstr[0] "イリダンの小道"
msgstr[1] "イリダンの小道"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=orange][b]Iridan shines brightly, revealing a path "
"forward.[/b][/color]"
msgstr "[color=orange][b]イリダンが明るく輝き、進むべき道を示しています。[/b][/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Syllia's Pathway"
msgid_plural "Syllia's Pathway"
msgstr[0] "シリアの小道"
msgstr[1] "シリアの小道"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyObservationEvent.Observation
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"[color=orange][b]Syllia shines brightly, revealing a path "
"forward.[/b][/color]"
msgstr "[color=orange][b]シリアが明るく輝き、進むべき道を示しています。[/b][/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AstrologyTableEvent.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgctxt "PluralName"
msgid "Rare Event"
msgid_plural "Rare Events"
msgstr[0] "レアイベント"
msgstr[1] "レアイベント"

